# Scan: (SANE, which talks to scanners, is in 45.) Tesseract reads the text (English, plus the languages most used
# in Europe; more are one package away: tesseract-ocr-<language>); OpenCV finds a page's corners in a photo.
tesseract-ocr
tesseract-ocr-eng
tesseract-ocr-deu
tesseract-ocr-fra
tesseract-ocr-spa
tesseract-ocr-ita
tesseract-ocr-nor
python3-opencv
# Machines: QEMU with KVM, its disk tools, UEFI firmware (with Secure Boot) and a software TPM for Windows 11.
qemu-system-x86
qemu-utils
ovmf
swtpm
swtpm-tools
# Tempo: FluidSynth renders the General MIDI instruments from a sound font; numpy (already in) and SciPy's filters
# do the rest (the effects, the mixer's EQ and compressor run through scipy.signal.lfilter).
python3-scipy
fluidsynth
fluid-soundfont-gm
